@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] lilly-tests-unprivileged-default
Ordinary Lilly unit/property tests MUST run without root or KVM. Host state and
process fixtures MUST use isolated temporary resources and clean their own
children and files without altering enrolled host or guest resources.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] lilly-tests-uncertainty
Tests for durable receipts, intent, terminal input and outcomes MUST include
duplicates, stale generations and restart/uncertain-result cases. A mocked
executor success MUST NOT count as real jail, networking or persistent-disk
acceptance.
